From 412de30cfa696e2ca40273280fa9166317f1f493 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:20:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] App: keep a Studio approval card full width once someone else
 answered it

On the Approvals page the cards sit in a start-aligned column, so when the
Approve / Decline buttons gave way to who answered, the card shrank to its
text. Give the card the full width; widget test covers it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QtAegQeJfjcVt7NtMf7qnx
---
